<title>NETHERLANDS: PolyGram shares falls on earnings warning.</title>
<headline>PolyGram shares falls on earnings warning.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Anglo-Dutch music and entertainment group PolyGram dropped 5.60 guilders or over six percent to 79.30 guilders in early trade on Wednesday after it said full-year operating results would be flat or slightly below last year's.</p>
<p>The company blamed lower than expected music sales.</p>
<p>PolyGram also said its 1996 result would include a one-off reorganisation charge of $90 million as a result of restructuring its music operations.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
